  "claim_boundary": "This protocol materializes one development-only frozen linear relationship-condition reader from exactly four already-frozen condition-only training texts and their training labels, plus one precomputed public embedding table covering the 224 label-free public challenge texts pinned by the v6 preflight and all 1,881 unique source-v4 reader observations. It does not claim or establish that those 224 texts are the admitted source-v3 calibration set; that exact join belongs to a later theta0 calibration bundle. It deliberately does not read challenge labels or sealed source-v4 files, run reader rehearsal or qualification, score held-out rows, create a public anchor, authorize Product Horizon execution, or establish Readable or any four-able effect. Its sole use is to freeze real pinned-BGE inputs before Product Horizon development outcomes exist."
